Package: brms.deeprv
Title: Pre-Trained Deep Random-Variate Decoders for 'brms'
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Seth", "Flaxman", , "flaxter@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Companion to 'brms' that injects pre-trained MLPDeepRV
    decoders as a 'deepRV()' formula term, giving Gaussian-process-like
    spatial smooths at a fixed-grid for a small fraction of the cost of
    an exact 'gp()' fit. Decoders are shipped per (domain, grid_size,
    kernel) and validated by a SHA-256 fingerprint at load time. v0.1
    targets the unit interval and (via Kronecker composition) the unit
    square.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
